Cerbere Security Shield
=======================

This product includes or uses the following third-party components:

1. WinDivert — https://reqrypt.org/windivert.html
   License: LGPLv3 (see licenses/LGPL-3.0.txt). The official signed
   driver and DLL are used unmodified via dynamic linking.

2. pydivert — https://github.com/ffalcinelli/pydivert
   License: LGPLv3 (see licenses/LGPL-3.0.txt). Python binding for
   WinDivert, installed via pip.

3. EasyList & EasyPrivacy — https://easylist.to/
   © The EasyList authors (https://easylist.to/).
   License: GPLv3 or CC BY-SA 3.0, dual license (see licenses/).
   The lists are downloaded unmodified from easylist.to on the
   end-user's machine and are never redistributed by this project.

4. AdGuard DNS Filter — https://github.com/AdguardTeam/AdGuardSDNSFilter
   License: GPLv3.
   Downloaded unmodified from the official repository at runtime;
   never redistributed by this project.

5. OISD — https://oisd.nl
   License: GPLv3.
   Downloaded unmodified from https://big.oisd.nl at runtime;
   never redistributed by this project.

6. HaGeZi DNS Blocklists — https://github.com/hagezi/dns-blocklists
   License: GPLv3.
   Downloaded unmodified from the official repository at runtime;
   never redistributed by this project.

7. MalwareBazaar — https://bazaar.abuse.ch/
   Free API by abuse.ch, used for SHA-256 reputation lookups only.

All other components are native Windows APIs or first-party code.
